sts\n- `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Updated reset logic, added 1 test for cancelled order rejection\n\n**Tests:**\n- `creates an order and returns 201` — Verifies new ACTIVE status appears on creation\n- `reads back a created order` — Verifies ACTIVE status persists in retrieval\n- `cancels an active order and returns 200 with cancelled status` — Core cancel behavior\n- `cancelling an already cancelled order succeeds without changes` — Idempotent retry safety\n- `cancelling an order with confirmed shipment fails with 409 and changes nothing` — All-or-nothing constraint with CONFIRMED\n- `cancelling a nonexistent order returns 404` — Error case for missing resource\n- `cancelling an order cancels all created shipments` — Cascade cancellation of CREATED shipments\n- `rejects shipment creation for a cancelled order with error envelope` — Prevents shipment creation on CANCELLED orders\n\n**Verification:** Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ directory. Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 19 tests, 0 failures, 0 errors. All existing tests pass, all new tests pass.\n\n**Not done:** None. All requirements met, all acceptance criteria satisfied."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3337,"cache_read_input_tokens":35449,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3337},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7bfb387-b954-4db1-af3d-d1aff8fad5a0","uuid":"dc8b5867-3c3c-4825-84e9-b079aad20031","timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:48:32.012Z","request_id":"req_011CevLWMh5EHRWLF3C9nwFa"}
